Subject: [PATCH v2 1/5] ath10k: Ensure txrx-compl-task is stopped when
 cleaning htt-tx.
Date: Fri,  1 Apr 2016 14:12:08 -0700
Message-Id: <1459545132-11295-1-git-send-email-greearb@candelatech.com>
List-Id: <ath10k.lists.infradead.org>
